        "value": "moribund",
        "source": "glottolog-cldf-v5.3",
        "note": "Niitsipowahsin (1677-bla) = Severely Endangered (100 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (Significant revitalization efforts are underway, including culture and language instruction at public schools and colleges: Cuts Wood School (Browning, MT), Blackfeet Community College, University of Montana, University of Lethbridge, Red Crow College. (Prins, 2019)) [Prins 2019](cldf:prins:19)",
        "scale": "glottolog-cldf-v5.3"
      },
